<view class="page cart-page"><view class="cart-head"><view><text class="cart-title">购物车</text><text class="cart-sub">挑选好味道，慢慢来</text></view><text wx:if="{{lines.length}}" bindtap="clear">清空</text></view><view wx:if="{{!lines.length && !loading}}" class="empty"><text class="empty-icon">🛒</text><text>购物车还是空的</text><button class="btn" bindtap="goMenu">去看看菜品</button></view><view wx:for="{{lines}}" wx:key="key" class="cart-line card"><text class="cart-line__check {{item.selected ? 'cart-line__check--on' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="toggle">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</text><view class="cart-line__image"><image wx:if="{{item.imageUrl}}" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text wx:else>✦</text></view><view class="cart-line__body"><text class="cart-line__name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="cart-line__spec" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="edit">{{item.label}} ▾</text><text wx:if="{{item.soldOut}}" class="cart-line__warning">库存不足，请调整数量</text><view class="cart-line__bottom"><text class="price">{{item.priceText}}</text><view class="cart-line__step"><text data-key="{{item.key}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="quantity">−</text><text>{{item.quantity}}</text><text data-key="{{item.key}}" data-step="1" bindtap="quantity">＋</text></view></view></view><text class="cart-line__remove" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="remove">×</text></view><view wx:if="{{lines.length}}" class="cart-hint">价格以提交订单时的菜品信息为准。订单仅支持到店自取。</view><view wx:if="{{lines.length}}" class="bottom-bar"><text class="cart-select" bindtap="toggleAll">{{allSelected ? '◉' : '◯'}} 全选</text><view class="bottom-bar__total"><text class="muted">合计</text><strong class="price">{{total}}</strong></view><button class="btn" bindtap="checkout">结算 ({{count}})</button></view></view>
